BEGIN ~KKNavB~

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Minsc")
Global("KKNMinstalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Minsc",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Minsc")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NMinstalk
~You! Simple-minded fool!~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNMinstalk","LOCALS",1)~
== BMINSC ~Speaking to Minsc that way is not nice! We are both mighty warriors, are we not?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Do not compare yourself to me, Rasheman swine. I demand to know what that thing is! I caught it scurrying about in my pack this morn.~
== BMINSC ~Boo says lady barbarian deserves a righteous butt-kicking, for speaking to us this way!~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Though I would enjoy a bit sport watching you try, I am not in the mood. And again, what is that thing? You call it Boo?~
== BMINSC ~Boo is a miniature giant space hamster and smart too!~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Smarter than you, by far.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Minsc")
Global("KKNMinstalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Minsc",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Minsc")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NMinstalk2
~I have been watching you Minsc, and it seems I have misjudged you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNMinstalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== BMINSC ~Oh? Boo thinks Navarra feels bad for insulting Minsc.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I think that in spite of you being addle-brained, you are very loyal to <CHARNAME>, and quite skilled in battle. I... respect that~
== BMINSC ~<CHARNAME> is friend to Minsc and Boo! Boo says Navarra is fierce warrior also, and together we will stab evil in it's black heart!~
== ~KKNavB~ ~That we will Minsc, and leave nothing but corpses in our wake!~
EXIT

CHAIN IF 
~Global("NavAnoTalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Anomen",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!AreaType(DUNGEON)
InParty("Navarra")
See("Navarra")
~ THEN BANOMEN NavAno
~I see you are a warrior, my lady. Are you familiar with Helm by chance?~ DO ~SetGlobal("NavAnoTalk","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Helm? What is a helm?.~
== BANOMEN ~I fear you feign ignorance of Helm, simply to mock me! I find it insulting.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Arrogant male! It is you who insults me because I do not know. I am from Narfell and only Lathander, Tempus and Waukeen are worshiped there.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I have never left my home, until recently. I am still learning about life here, and the culture.~
== BANOMEN ~Then I am sorry, my lady. I truly meant no offense. Would you like to learn more of Helm?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~No. My tribe worships Tempus, and I am most faithful.~
EXIT

CHAIN IF 
~Global("NavAnoTalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Anomen",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!AreaType(DUNGEON)
InParty("Navarra")
See("Navarra")
~ THEN BANOMEN NavAno2
~My lady, might I bend your ear a moment? There is something I must ask you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("NavAnoTalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~If you must, male. What is it that you wish to know?~
== BANOMEN ~I have heard, though I am loathe to believe it, that your tribe regards men as slaves and treats them as such.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~That is true, I have not tried to hide it from anyone. I assume that bothers you to know that.~
== BANOMEN ~Indeed it does! Slavery is illegal, immoral and cannot be tolerated!~
== ~KKNavB~ ~And your question is....?~
== BANOMEN ~How is it that you can commit such immoral acts against men, yet worship Tempus? Is he not a man?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~My tribe has always worshiped Tempus.~ 
== ~KKNavB~ ~Tempus is the god of war, and my people are always at war. Either against the weather or the monsters that plague the land.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~His concerns are honorable battles and forbids cowardice. Barabarians are definately not cowards.~
EXIT

CHAIN IF 
~Global("NavVictalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Viconia",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!AreaType(DUNGEON)
See("Viconia")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NVictalk
~Why would those filthy males do that to you, just for being drow?~ DO ~SetGlobal("NavVictalk","LOCALS",1)~
== BVICONI  ~That is the only reason, foolish woman!~
== ~KKNavB~ ~There is no reason to insult me, just for asking. I have seen a drow before.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~There are none in Narfell. Regardless, they deserved death for even daring to harm a woman.~
== BVICONI  ~I have heard of the tribes, fierce warriors.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I suspect you are a fierce warrior, yourself. I think we will get a long very well.~
EXIT

CHAIN IF 
~Global("KKNVictalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Viconia",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Viconia")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NVictalk2
~Where are you from, Viconia?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNVictalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== BVICONI  ~Ust Natha.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~What is it like there? I would love to see it.~
== BVICONI  ~You would not want to be there. It is evil.~
== BVICONI  ~From what I have heard, the slave pens might interest you.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Slave pens? Can I have one?~
== BVICONI  ~No.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Buy one?~
== BVICONI  ~No.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNVictalk3","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Viconia",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Viconia")
~ THEN ~BVICONI~ NVictalk3
~Surely there are slaves in this filthy cesspool. Why do you want one of ours?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNVictalk3","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Global("FreeSlaves","GLOBAL",1)~ ~There were, until <CHARNAME> freed them. I am not used to having to do everything for myself.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~!Global("FreeSlaves","GLOBAL",1)~ ~If there are, I know not where. I am not used to having to do everything for myself.~
== BVICONI ~Drow males are trained in the erotic arts, for sex.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Global("KKEDSex","GLOBAL",1)~ ~Well, I do not need one of those.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~!Global("KKEDSex","GLOBAL",1)~ ~Sounds perfect. Are you sure I cannot have one?~
== BVICONI  ~Global("KKEDSex","GLOBAL",1)~ ~Drow males are highly skilled, unlike that Thayvian male you are amusing yourself with.~
== BVICONI  ~!Global("KKEDSex","GLOBAL",1)~ ~I am.~
== BEDWIN IF ~InParty("Edwin") See("Edwin") !StateCheck("Edwin",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)~ ~There is no match for my prowness, simian, No one pleases the ladies beeter than Edwin Odesseiron!~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNKortalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("KORGAN",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("KKNavar")
~ THEN ~BKORGAN~ NKortalk
~Ye be a fine lookin' lass.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNKortalk","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~You dare speak to me, dwarf?~
== BKORGAN ~Ye cannae take a compliment?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~To do so would mean I would have to lower myself to speak to a male.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNKortalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("KORGAN",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("KKNavar")
~ THEN ~BKORGAN~ NKortalk2
~Ye're wastin' yer time sweet talkin' that wizard, gel.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNKortalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I fail to see how that is any of your business, male.~
== BKORGAN ~Ye must know he only loves himself. Now, if ye wan' a real man.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Not even in your dreams, dwarf.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNJahtalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Jaheira",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("KKNavar")
~ THEN ~BJAHEIR~ NJahtalk
~You have some nerve referring to men as property to be used and mistreated.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNJahtalk","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Because that is what they are. They have no other purpose.~
== BJAHEIR ~Gender(Player1,MALE)~ ~I am responsible for <CHARNAME>, and I will not let you treat him, that way.~
== BJAHEIR ~!Gender(Player1,MALE)~ ~Hmf! Foolish girl! You have no idea what your a talking about.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNJahtalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Jaheira",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("KKNavar")
~ THEN ~BJAHEIR~ NJahtalk2
~I knew you were foolish, but Edwin? Have you no self respect?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNJahtalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Why do you care? You do not even like him.~
== BJAHEIR ~Edwin is evil and cares for no one. You could have chosen someone more appropriate?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Gender(Player1,MALE)~ ~More appropriate? Like <CHARNAME> perhaps? Edwin is easy to manipulate.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Gender(Player1,MALE)~ ~<CHARNAME> is not.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("MAZZY")
Global("KKNMaztalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("MAZZY",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("MAZZY")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NMaztalk
~You are a very skilled warrior, Mazzy. Quite impressive.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNMaztalk","LOCALS",1)~
== BMAZZY ~Thank you. I have had a lifetime to train.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~What made you decide to be a paladin?~
== BMAZZY ~It is calling, Navarra. My God required my service, and I answered.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNMaztalk2","LOCALS",0)
Global("NavHasSword","LOCALS",1)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("KKNavar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("KKNavar")
~ THEN ~BMAZZY~ NMaztalk2
~You must be happy to have reclaimed the sword.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNMaztalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Very, it has been a long search.~
== BMAZZY ~It is a fine blade, to be sure.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~That it is. Chieftain Osarena will be pleased by the swords safe return.~
== BMAZZY  ~You will be returning to Narfell then?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ ~To return the sword, yes. What I do after that, <CHARNAME> and I have not decided where we want to live yet.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ ~To return the sword, yes. What I do after that, I have not decided.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2) !Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1)~ ~To return the sword, yes. What I do after that, I have not decided.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2) !Global("KKEDRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2) !Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ ~To return the sword, yes. What I do after that, Edwin and I still need to discuss that.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Valygar")
Global("KKNValtalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Valygar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
AreaType(OUTDOOR)
AreaType(FOREST)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Valygar")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NValtalk
~Why are you digging around in the dirt?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNValtalk","LOCALS",1)~
== BVALYGA ~There are some nice mushrooms here, for the stew.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~How do you know which ones are edible?~
== BVALYGA ~I would make a poor ranger if I did not.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Valygar")
Global("KKNValtalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Valygar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Valygar")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NValtalk2
~I found this a ways back, it looks like flint.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNValtalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== BVALYGA ~Indeed it is, a fine piece too.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I suspected as much. I picked it up thinking you may need more.~
== BVALYGA ~That I do. Thank you.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Cernd")
Global("KKNCertalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Cernd",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
