== BCERND ~I placed Ahsdale where he can grow up protected.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Protected from being raised by an irresponsible male.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Aerie")
Global("KKNAertalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Aerie",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Aerie")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NAertalk
~What is wrong with you?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNAertalk","LOCALS",1)~
== BAERIE ~What do you mean?.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I never met a female who whines so much. You are like a one woman pity party.~
== BAERIE ~T-that's not fair! I have been though a lot.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~That should make strong, not turn you into a sniveling baby.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNAertalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("KKNavar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("KKNavar")
~ THEN ~BAERIE~ NAertalk2
~Why are you so mean to me?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNAertalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I never meant to be mean. I know you were tortured and lost your wings.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I know what I said sounded harsh. No woman deserves any of that.~
== BAERIE ~No one does, not just women.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Debatable, but I am sorry for upsetting you.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("NALIA")
Global("KKNNaltalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("NALIA",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("NALIA")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NNaltalk
~How dare you hold yourself above those with less than you?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNNaltalk","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~My people have a motto, Deed, not blood.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~It is our deeds that set us above the rest. Not someones birth.~
== BNALIA ~I don't think I'm better, just better off than those who are poor.~
== BNALIA ~And, I have helped some of them before. Isn't that a good deed?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~How? Gave them coin, and rubbed your birth in their faces?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~And to who? These filthy males? They will sit and drink until the last coin is gone.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Women are the only ones with sense enough to make good use of it.~
== BNALIA ~Of course I gave them coin. They have to eat.~
== BNALIA ~And furthermore, women are no better then men. Why would you say such a thing?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Because we are. Well, maybe not you.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("NALIA")
Global("KKNNaltalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("NALIA",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("NALIA")
~ THEN ~KKNavB~ NNaltalk2
~I have come to realize that, you are the way you are, because of how you were raised~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNNaltalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~You were raised to believe nobility and wealth sets you above the rest.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~The same holds true for myself. I was raised to believe that men have no purpose but as slaves.~
== BNALIA ~In my case, it is true. But for you, that is just wrong. No one deserves to be a slave.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Well, I was going to apologize for what I said earlier. Not anymore.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNYostalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("KKNavar",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("KKNavar")
~ THEN ~BYOSHIM~ NYostalk
~Friend Navarra! How do you fair, this fine day?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNYostalk","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I am no friend of yours, male.~
== BYOSHIM ~Such a harsh welcome! What is it I have done to cause such offense?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Other than the fact you are a male, nothing.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Yoshimo")
Global("KKNYostalk2","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Yoshimo",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Yoshimo")
~ THEN ~KKNavar~ NYostalk2
~It seems I have misjudged you, Yoshimo.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNYostalk2","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~For being a thief, you are an honorable one.~
== BYOSHIM ~What brings you to this conclusion?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~You have not robbed any of us. I only saw you rob someone in the Copper Coronet.~
== BYOSHIM ~You have a very keen eye, friend Navarra, not many can catch me.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~We Nars have to be prepared for anything. It takes a keen eye to survive.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Imoen2")
Global("KKNImotalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Imoen2",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Imoen2")
~ THEN ~KKNavar~ NImotalk
~It is a pleasure to finally meet you, Imoen. I have heard much about you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNImotalk","LOCALS",1)~
== BIMOEN2 ~Don't believe everything you hear.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~What I believe is, you have been through a horrible experience.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~And remained strong, in spite of it. I am Navarra, by the way.~
== BIMOEN2 ~It's nice to meet you, Navarra. And thank you, though I don't feel very strong right now.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~All will be well now, you will see.~
EXIT

CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("Jan")
Global("KKNJantalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Jan",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("Jan")
~ THEN ~KKNavar~ NJantalk
~What is that foul odor?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNJantalk","LOCALS",1)~
== BJAN ~You don't like the smell of turnips?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Turnips? You smell like mud and dung!~
== BJAN ~Dung makes an excellent fertilizer, you know. My grandaunt..~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Stop right there! One more of your stories and I will flay you alive.~
