CHAIN
IF 
~InParty("KKNavar")
Global("KKNKeltalk","LOCALS",0)
!StateCheck(Myself,CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
!StateCheck("Keldorn",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)
CombatCounter(0)
!See([ENEMY])
See("KKNavar")
~ THEN ~KKNavar~ NKeltalk
~What is that symbol you are wearing?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNKeltalk","LOCALS",1)~
== ~KKNavB~ ~A blazing silver sword on a blood-red shield.~ 
== BKELDOR ~What does it represent? It seems I should know, somehow.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~It is the symbol of Tempus.~
== BKELDOR ~Tempus! How could you worship such a bloodthirsty God?~
== ~KKNavB~ ~I am a barbarian, you self-righteous fool.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Tempus cares not for blood. He praises honorable battles and forbids cowardice.~
== ~KKNavB~ ~Using my sword to settle a dispute, does not make me bloodthirsty.~
EXIT

